        "pseudocode": "LANDAUER_COST(n_erased_bits, kB, T):\n  entropy_drop \u2190 n * ln(2)\n  heat_cost \u2190 kB * T * entropy_drop\n  return heat_cost\n\nComplexity: O(1)",
        "code": "import math\ndef landauer_cost(n_bits, kB=1.380649e-23, T=300.0):\n    return kB * T * n_bits * math.log(2)",
